    "title": "London man arrested after allegedly assaulting woman in her apartment - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dustin Massengill ,\n2 hours ago LONDON, Ky. ( FOX 56 ) — A London man is arrested for assault after reportedly forcing his way into a woman’s apartment.\nThe Laurel County Sheriff’s Office said 50-year-old Corey Posey was arrested Tuesday at an apartment complex in southern Laurel County.\nLATEST KENTUCKY NEWS: Posey reportedly forced his way inside a woman’s apartment, threatening the woman and striking her in the back of the head and neck.\nHe was charged with third-degree burglary, fourth-degree assault, second-degree terroristic threatening, and second-degree criminal mischief.\nHe was lodged in the Laurel County Correctional Center.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to FOX 56 News.",
